        "description": "Sensorineural hearing loss",
        "category": "minor",
        "requiredForDiagnosis": false
      }
    ],
    "minimumForDiagnosis": "Presence of all three major criteria: ocular anomalies, craniofacial dysmorphism, and intellectual disability",
    "notes": "Genetic testing may support diagnosis but is not mandatory."
